1
00:00:00,644 --> 00:00:02,024
(Penny:)Oh. That's so sweet.

2
00:00:02,187 --> 00:00:04,227
(Penny:)But I'm going out dancing
with a girlfriend.

3
00:00:04,398 --> 00:00:06,688
You can't go out, it's "Halo" night.

4
00:00:07,067 --> 00:00:09,237
(Penny:)Well, for Penny, it's dancing night.

5
00:00:09,403 --> 00:00:11,363
- You go dancing every Wednesday?
- No.

6
00:00:11,530 --> 00:00:12,820
(Sheldon:)Then it's not dancing night.

7
00:00:14,742 --> 00:00:16,322
Why don't I play with you tomorrow?

8
00:00:16,493 --> 00:00:19,953
Tonight is "Halo" night.
It's like talking to a wall.

9
00:00:20,914 --> 00:00:24,504
All right, now, Sheldon,
you and I are about to have a problem.

10
00:00:26,295 --> 00:00:28,425
(Leonard:)Sheldon, remember, we role-played this.

11
00:00:28,589 --> 00:00:31,339
(Sheldon:)Yes, but you didn't portray her
as completely irrational.

12
00:00:31,842 --> 00:00:33,802
All right, fellas, I gotta go.

13
00:00:33,969 --> 00:00:36,059
But good luck.

14
00:00:38,766 --> 00:00:42,436
Maybe we should've asked if we could go
dancing with her and her girlfriend.

15
00:00:42,603 --> 00:00:44,813
(Sheldon:)Okay, assuming we could dance,
which we can't...

16
00:00:44,980 --> 00:00:46,860
(Sheldon:)...there are three of us and two of them.

17
00:00:47,024 --> 00:00:51,324
(Penny:)- So?
- It's the Chinese restaurant all over again.

18
00:00:51,487 --> 00:00:54,487
(Sheldon:)I assure you that cutting
a dumpling in thirds is child's play...

19
00:00:54,656 --> 00:01:00,026
(Sheldon:)...compared with three men each attempting
to dance with 67 percent of a woman.

